  "translation": "I get up at seven every morning. I first brush my teeth and wash my face, then eat breakfast. I often drink a cup of milk and eat a piece of bread. Sometimes I also eat eggs. I also eat some fruit, any fruit at all. Starting at nine in the morning, I use my computer in the office. At noon, I go to the cafeteria with my colleagues to eat. We often eat rice and dishes; those dishes are very delicious. I get off work at five in the afternoon. After work, I sometimes go to the park for a slow walk. At seven in the evening, I cook dinner at home. After dinner, I watch TV for a while. Around half past ten, I take a bath and then go to sleep."
